{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ad73ea5dde9b488caf2b111748ac978cdde54f843a2588b38e77bedecaeed60e", "ja": "（麗花が、次のステージに使いたいものがあるとかで、\n買い出しする事になった。一体なんだろう……？）", "zh": "（丽花说想在接下来的表演中使用某样东西，\n于是我们一起去采购。到底是什么东西呢……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "9217fc812387c925c8dea9c5a992c633c48bb8f6d1fbe4fda23581aeb48432dc", "ja": "ふんふんふーん♪　あ、おはようございます、\n{$P$}さん。お待たせしました！", "zh": "啦啦啦──♪啊，{$P$}先生，\n早安，让你久等了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "0fcd06d9462f01b97feb8c85053ed3c19d4bbb858b16094a38fa11fb846370f9", "ja": "起きたら、服が見つからなくて。もう\nパジャマでいいかな～って思ったんですけど。", "zh": "我早上起床后找不到衣服，\n本来还想说干脆穿睡衣来算了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1003_p", "source_sha256": "86585a7ee170ac955a47ac428d8a8d996b592126b8f14dda5d1345c733bd6980", "ja": "おはよう、麗花。\nいや、踏みとどまってくれてよかったよ……。", "zh": "丽花，早安。\n呃，幸好你打消了这个念头……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "b6999ffd10fb79acd4fc94ecae528b7601f793425a398f59f163cdda8436a686", "ja": "はい♪　今日は{$P$}さんに、\n私のお買い物に付き合ってもらわないとですから！", "zh": "是的♪因为今天必须\n请{$P$}先生陪我去买东西才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "8d5b81c095dce342da50f28fb12a5c7d0caa074c1649ed43092378ea4b192d20", "ja": "{$P$}さんとお出かけ、\n楽しみだな～。ふふっ！", "zh": "好期待跟{$P$}先生出门呢～\n呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e48d6dce4642405ce09d7ed45b910da4497530a9d14c855c07ba282f2ef989ca", "ja": "そう、その買い物の事なんだけど……\nステージに、何を飾りたいんだ？", "zh": "这样啊，那关于你要买的东西……\n你是想用什么东西装饰舞台？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "8f2146d55d1f3050f6fc153e6d074d5f021a8ad82a999d2c2275f42506372948", "ja": "えっと、お花を飾りたいなーって♪\nステージに飾ったら、素敵だと思いませんか？", "zh": "这个嘛，我想用花来装饰♪\n不觉得用花装饰舞台会很美吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "97b00db32161a797316bdb1df7bcbfea900cefdb60d674739c4bf8c84b090bf4", "ja": "お花に囲まれたステージ、きっと癒やされますよね！", "zh": "花朵环绕的舞台一定会让人觉得很疗愈吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0d5913265875363b37d3cf999effd9992dffa6d9ae23ecbcb40198710643276f", "ja": "素敵だとは思うけど……生花は日持ちしないし、\n照明に弱いから、どうだろうな。", "zh": "是很美啦……但鲜花不耐放，\n又怕灯光直射，很难说好不好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "dd8258622a2af8ad4b65bca25ffa57c1ceb4898a76f9017b13d4a84dcba75e7f", "ja": "大丈夫です！　庭師デューサーさんが、\nちゃんとお世話をしてくれますから。", "zh": "没问题的！\n因为园丁制作人会好好照顾那些花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1011_p", "source_sha256": "faaa590ec9ab0aa3dc09359b35b62b57ca0825747bc41e61847e4bbf5b1b3fc7", "ja": "それは俺なのか？\nいや、本番中には上がれないしな……。", "zh": "那是指我吗？\n不是，我在正式表演时又不能上台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "e741ab6e6318c8c05749b5daf02e4574263879b0eb7f289c9cd4b25d04ec103a", "ja": "あっ、そうですよね！\nう～ん、お花はダメですか？", "zh": "啊，说得也是呢！\n唔～用花不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f4738b70354ff622f1c94300f2173ff317534cfe23843e91a25ecafa2ef9857f", "ja": "いや。劇場のステージで生花は難しいけど、\n造花なら飾れると思うよ。", "zh": "倒也不是，在剧场的舞台上用鲜花装饰有困难，\n但换成人造花应该就可以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "2a0deff8e1eaa825eef7a6d42b9312d557c660c8fac5e7c548ed5b9a1d541656", "ja": "わかりました！　それじゃステージには造花を飾って、\n生花は、劇場のエントランスに飾りますね♪", "zh": "我明白了！那就用人造花装饰舞台，\n用鲜花装饰剧场的大厅吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "371308510f7ce2c6bd86c15ed02f96c056a3f4311f25262ef2e2a1ffe78fa809", "ja": "いい匂いがするし、きっとファンのみんなも、\nわーいわーい！って、よろこんでくれると思うんです。", "zh": "花这么香，粉丝们一定也会很喜欢，\n兴奋地哇哇叫的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1016_p", "source_sha256": "98923179780e350ae1df6497061117c0590edfda9deb8158a4bb7e1a729bd410", "ja": "劇場に飾るのはいいんだけど、エントランスには\nフラスタもあるから、被っちゃわないか？", "zh": "装饰在剧场是可以，但大厅还会摆花篮，\n这样不会重复吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "e69d87c3be1939d33233fed79da1b4c86462dab034f90e4082f73df896fc93bc", "ja": "あっ、そっか！\n{$P$}さん、どうしましょう……？", "zh": "啊，对喔！\n{$P$}先生，我该怎么办……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1018_p", "source_sha256": "5ae476b3b4d2d09d4decf9d59f64615059a1043db8915f381762184dcb757698", "ja": "そうだな。飾るなら、控え室がいいかもな。\nみんなも喜ぶと思うよ。", "zh": "我想想，既然要装饰，摆在准备室里可能不错吧。\n大家应该也会很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "e522e156e8663837619e4a4b4259bd1966a1bf417a6c697956d3cfeeb5cfa585", "ja": "わー、ナイス普通な答えですね！\nさすが{$P$}さんです♪", "zh": "哇──真是平凡得让人赞叹的回答呢！\n不愧是{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1020_p", "source_sha256": "f317ce80391ca7400703402c81ca41e69408a14bb8e03730d2dc350795578cf3", "ja": "う、うん、ありがとう……？", "zh": "啊、嗯，谢谢称赞……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0093_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "11c60950cd100c7ddcf6915ccb869edd6da9775f80fa4e4ef4086a4da4ceeba0", "ja": "そうと決まったら、さっそく買いにいきましょう！\n早く早く♪", "zh": "既然决定好了，就赶快去买吧！\n快点快点♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
